abstract: >-
  Implementation-first Windows 11 Home, Windows 11 Pro, and macOS Apple
  Silicon runbooks for network baselines, 2/2 Gbps validation, bounded
  simultaneous aggregate evidence, latency and Wi-Fi analysis, direct-host
  and eero-wide failover, and documentation-backed 5/5 and 10/10 Gbps methods.
